<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch NKF details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Dutch NKF details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch cable maker NKF Holding NV said on Monday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 24 held.</p>
<p>In February, NKF announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.25 guilders. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>NKF shares were trading  at  52.50 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, down 0.30 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
